<title>USA: Quality Food Centers sells 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Quality Food Centers sells 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144A issue from Quality Food Centers Inc was priced on Friday in the private placement market, according to lead manager Donaldson Lufkin Jenrette Securities Corp.</p>
<p>BORROWER QUALITY FOOD CENTERS INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 8.70 PCT   MATURITY 3/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 9/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B1    YIELD 8.70 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-PLUS    SPREAD 200 BPS    CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
